      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      160.47,
      326.5,
      186.4
    ],
    "text": "5. Section 83 of the principal enactment is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      197.53,
      326.52,
      247.9
    ],
    "text": "(1) in subsection (1) of that section by the substitution for the words and figures \u201csections 54A and 54B\u201d, of the words and figures \u201csections 54A, 54AA and 54B\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      259.03,
      326.51,
      334.0
    ],
    "text": "(2) in subsection (2) of that section by the substitution for the words and figures \u201csubsection (1) of section 54A and section 54B\u201d, of the words and figures \u201csubsection (1) of sections 54A, subsection (1) of section 54AA and section 54B\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
